OL,3,GNEWSASeven new roles created at opera
OL,4,Ahouse
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn opera house has created seven new
OL,7,Fjobs as part of its expansion plans.
OL,9,FBosses at Jersey Opera House said they
OL,10,Fwere looking for three heads of
OL,11,Fdepartment, two officers, a senior
OL,12,Ftechnician and a supervisor.
OL,14,FA spokesperson for the opera house said
OL,15,Fthe new roles formed part of plans to
OL,16,Fgrow its programme and activity.
OL,18,FThey added the team was also keen to
OL,19,Fhear from people who would like to work
OL,20,Fat the venue on a casual basis.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
